      },
      "message": "fix(fidelity): a stock copy of an incomplete model keeps naming its hole\n\nA FromModel stock copy now carries its source's hole (MeshOpen) beside\nthe fidelity-unknown sentinel through SetStock, setup clone and\ndelete-undo, UpdateModel's copy refresh, and save/load. The refusal\nreads the hole off the entity that carries the sentinel, so a copy whose\nsource is deleted no longer falls back to the \"saved before CamCraft\nrecorded mesh fidelity\" note.\n\nFixes #1700\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
